OL,3,GNEWSAMum in 'survival mode' after three
OL,4,Ahours in car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum has described going into
OL,7,F"survival mode" after being "stranded"
OL,8,Fin the multi-storey car park of a
OL,9,Fshopping centre as traffic gridlock
OL,10,Ftook hold of a city.
OL,12,FEmily Strange was stuck in the Westgate
OL,13,Fcar park in Oxford for about three
OL,14,Fhours on Sunday alongside her partner
OL,15,Fand their two children, the youngest of
OL,16,Fwhich is 10 months old.
OL,18,FShoppers and drivers complained of
OL,19,Fgridlock across the city centre during
OL,20,Fthe weekend following the introduction
OL,21,Fof a new traffic filter trial and the
OL,22,FOxford Half Marathon.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
